  "description": "Turn-Key Three-Storey End-of-Terrace Home in Headford Town\n\nAn excellent opportunity to acquire a superb turn-key, three-storey end-of-terrace property ideally situated in Headford Town, County Galway. Conveniently located approximately 16 miles from Galway City, the property offers an attractive combination of modern accommodation, excellent local amenities and easy access to the city.\n\nHeadford is a thriving town with an excellent range of facilities and services close at hand, including primary and secondary schools, Tesco, hotel accommodation, sports and recreational facilities, together with a range of local shops and services. Public transport is also readily accessible, with a bus stop conveniently located at the entrance to the estate.\n\nThe property is presented in turn-key condition and provides well-proportioned accommodation arranged over three floors.\n\nGround Floor\nOn entering, the property comprises a welcoming entrance hallway, guest WC, utility room and a modern fitted kitchen. The spacious open-plan living/dining room features attractive timber flooring and an insert stove, creating a warm and inviting focal point to the main living space. The kitchen and bathrooms are finished with tiled flooring.\n\nFirst Floor\nThe first floor provides two generous double bedrooms. The master bedroom benefits from a private en-suite, while both bedrooms feature fitted wardrobes and carpet flooring. A well-appointed family bathroom completes this level, featuring floor and full-height wall tiling and a separate bath.\n\nTop Floor\nThe top floor accommodates a further spacious double bedroom with built-in wardrobe and its own en-suite bathroom, providing an ideal private retreat or excellent accommodation for family members or guests.\n\nTo the front, there are two dedicated car parking spaces together with a paved approach. The rear garden is fully enclosed, offering a private and low-maintenance outdoor space with paved areas and a useful garden shed.\n\nServices\nThe property is serviced by mains water, mains sewerage and high-speed fibre broadband, making it ideally suited to modern family living and those working from home.\n\nOverall, this is a particularly attractive property for first-time buyers, families or those seeking a spacious home within easy commuting distance of Galway City. Its generous three-storey layout, three double bedrooms, three bathrooms, modern kitchen, private rear garden and excellent connectivity make it an excellent opportunity in the Headford market.\n\nViewing is highly recommended to fully appreciate the quality, space and convenient location this property has to offer.",
